{"ref":"BDB, בְּדָן","hw":"בְּדָן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בְּדָן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>= <span dir=\"rtl\">עַבְדָּן</span>?<strong>)</strong>.<br><strong>1.</strong>  a judge of Israel <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 12:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.12.11\">1 S 12:11</a>; but read prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּרָק</span>, so 𝔊 𝔖 We, cf. Dr (v. <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:6\" href=\"/Judges.4.6\">Ju 4:6f.</a>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  a Manassite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.17\">1 Ch 7:17</a>.","next":"BDB, בדק","prev":"BDB, בְּדֹ֫לַח"}